    // Part of the colonist branch, after food: the starting protein covers the first week, and
    // a colonist starving while the extractor is researched is worse than a late disposal.
    // The accepted trade-off is that infected bodies left too long burst into crawlers.
    // Not scenario-locked: any scenario can receive infected corpses (a dropped stasis pod
    // brings dead travelers), so the validator holds the quest until one is actually aboard,
    // wherever it came from.
